      "DATES INTERNALLY CONTRADICTORY (research 2026-07-03): birth given as 1780 (Limerick), a baptism event dated 14 Sep 1824 (44 years later — implausible as his own first baptism), and parents' (Garrett Fitzgerald x Elizabeth Davison) marriage dated 20 Nov 1803, Brighton, Sussex — 23 years after his own stated 1780 birth, which as recorded is impossible. Likely explanations: his birth year is mistranscribed (a birth in the late 1820s would resolve both the parent-marriage gap and bring the 1824 event closer to plausible); the 1824 baptism belongs to a different Fitzgerald relative merged onto this record; or Garrett Fitzgerald/Elizabeth Davison are not in fact his biological parents. This cluster also surfaces independently in this repo's gen06-patrick-donovan-bridget-crowly.md dossier (daughter Bridget Crowly's surname mismatch). Recommendation: treat every date on this Fitzgerald/Davison/Butler cluster as unverified pending the underlying source-index images."
